From: Oratile Moletsane <sebatamoletsane950@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 07:35:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add Victorian architectural style to settlement
 generation system
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Add facadeVariant (0=standard, 1=bay window, 2=full Victorian), windowCount, corniceBlock, gableTrim, hasDormers, bayWindowWidth to all 48 blueprints (12 per tier: village/town/castle/kingdom)
- Add corresponding 6 properties to Building interface in settlements.ts
- Victorian details vary by tier: farms/cottages have simpler styles, palaces/mansions have full Victorian details (bay windows, dormers, gold/marble cornices)
- Data-driven through existing blueprint roster system — generator reads new properties while maintaining layout, road, and spatial planning logic

Co-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>
---
 artifacts/pixel-wilds/src/game/blueprints.ts  | 144 ++++++++++++------
 artifacts/pixel-wilds/src/game/settlements.ts |  12 ++
 artifacts/pixel-wilds/tsconfig.json           |   4 +-
 3 files changed, 108 insertions(+), 52 deletions(-)

